# Docker build context for the two Lambda images (lambda/*.Dockerfile).
#
# Deny by default: the Dockerfiles COPY only the project package and the
# locked requirements, so nothing else in the repository should ever reach
# the Docker daemon. This keeps .git, the virtualenv, test data, local
# runbook state and any operator configuration out of the context and out
# of the image, and makes builds fast.
*
!src/onebucket_demo/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!lambda/requirements-chunker.txt
!lambda/requirements-embedder.txt
# Never ship bytecode caches even inside the allowed tree.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
